        11("<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE ViewModels (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel and SimpleMVC]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Implement IView with a stable<br />ViewKey. Raise<br />CommandRequested, receive<br />correlated results on the UI<br />thread, and expose observable<br />properties through<br />ObservableObject.</div>")
        style 11 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        20("<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE State (Model)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Provides observable<br />workspace, presentation<br />culture, active document and<br />target, selected session,<br />availability, operation<br />state, interaction blocks by<br />scope, and diagnostics.</div>")
        style 20 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        22("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Session Coordinator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Opens a versioned adapter<br />session, owns its lifetime<br />and bundle lease, routes<br />typed capability requests,<br />and projects state, control<br />events, and bounded media<br />streams.</div>")
        style 22 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        24("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Debugger and Guest Inspectors</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Displays CPU-specific<br />registers, platform<br />disassembly, bounded memory<br />and bank selection, reference<br />timing, and advertised live<br />clock-phase or bus data.<br />Captures the user's<br />byte-order display choice and<br />exposes available raw and<br />guest inspection.</div>")
        style 24 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        25("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Debugger Target Model</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Validates the active<br />session's descriptor, CPU and<br />map revision. Projects<br />supporting views and bounded<br />inspection scope. Applies<br />Emulator default,<br />Little-endian, or Big-endian<br />to multibyte display values.</div>")
        style 25 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        26("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CPU References and Display Profiles</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET, declarative profile data]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves versioned register<br />and flag definitions, opcode<br />encodings, addressing rules,<br />reference timing and platform<br />display profiles for the<br />6502, 6809, Z80, 8080, 8086,<br />6800, and 68000 families.<br />Resolves package-supplied<br />declarative profiles to the<br />selected version.</div>")
        style 26 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        33("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Adapter Catalog and Host Contract</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Versioned .NET contracts]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Loads the pinned emulator<br />binding and its factory.<br />Negotiates session versions,<br />capability ports, optional<br />live debugger machine<br />descriptors, typed results,<br />resumable events, and<br />separate media streams.</div>")
        style 33 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        36("<div style='font-weight: bold'>ViceSharp Adapter</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: ViceSharp gRPC contracts]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Attaches to the configured<br />host and maps available<br />session metadata, debugger<br />descriptions, monitor, media,<br />snapshot, and diagnostics<br />services.</div>")
