    22-. "<div>1. Resolve the pinned adapter<br />binding and negotiate the<br />descriptor capability</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->33
    33-. "<div>2. Load the binding from the<br />leased, verified installed<br />version</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->39
