    11-. "<div>13. Observe the target<br />context, address limits and<br />available operations</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->20
    24-. "<div>14. Render target-specific<br />registers, disassembly,<br />memory and timing</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->11

